          "expr": "sum by (atomic_atom) (increase(atomic_schema_repairs_total{deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by (atomic_atom) (increase(atomic_step_attempts_total{deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
